Package: funbootband
Title: Simultaneous Prediction and Confidence Bands for Functional Data
Version: 0.3.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Daniel", "Koska", 
           email = "dkoska@proton.me", 
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"), 
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-8245-5222"))
Description: Computes simultaneous prediction and confidence bands for densely
    sampled functional data on a common grid. Supports independent curves and
    repeated curves from multiple subjects. For clustered data, an intact-subject
    bootstrap gives each subject equal weight. Clustered prediction targets one
    future curve from a new subject, whereas confidence bands target the
    subject-weighted population mean. Curves are represented by finite Fourier
    series, and an 'Rcpp' backend performs bootstrap calibration.
